      "status": "completed",
      "text": "Mara entered the Fulcrum conference room and looked around. She wasn't surprised to see four chairs; her interview invitation had listed the participants' names in order of seniority, and three chairs were occupied, while a fourth was empty in a space between her seat and Adrian's. But it took a moment to realize that each of the chairs was subtly different. Her chair was leather-wrapped; it rose from a narrow base with a low, flat back. The chairs beyond hers were upholstered in blue suede and had taller backs, with a lower, wider seat. Then, at the far end of the table, was an elaborate, wing-backed black velvet chair with a high, square back and a wide seat. It sat empty.",
