      "status": "completed",
      "text": "\"How long does that usually take?\"\nMara glanced over at Livia and Jonah, who'd come to collect her when the Fulcrum alignment was complete. Livia was waiting beside her with a warm drink; Jonah stood a bit behind and off to the side, his face neutral and his gaze focused on Mara's.\n\"Five, six hours.\" She stretched her arms, shaking out the tension. \"I'll be fine after I take care of myself for a little while.\"\n\"Do you think so?\"\nMara gave Livia a weary, faintly amused smile. \"Do I have a choice?\" she said.",
